<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Micromedical says has FDA approval.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Micromedical says has FDA approval.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia's Micromedical Industries Ltd said on Friday that the U.S. Food and Drug Administration had approved its electrocardiograph and patient management database system for U.S. sale.</p>
<p>The company said its Cardioview product would have its first U.S. sales in November.</p>
<p>Cardioview is a software system for management of electrocardiograph information and is used to manage cardiac patients in conjunction with other Micromedical monitoring products. The company did not issue estimated sales levels.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
